        "\n",
        "    Superivsor: Prof. [Kengo Kamatani](https://sites.google.com/view/kengokamatani/home)\n",
        "\n",
        "* **BA Mathematics**. _Department of Mathematics, University of Tokyo_. \\hfill [2019.4 -- 2023.3]{.cvdate}\n",
        "\n",
        "    Supervisor: Prof. [Nakahiro Yoshida](https://www.ms.u-tokyo.ac.jp/~nakahiro/hp-naka-e)\n",
